Package: volksmond
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE_KB@
Depends: gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, libgtk-3-0, libpulse0, xdg-utils
Maintainer: DigiPhyte (Pty) Ltd <info@digiphyte.com>
Homepage: https://volksmond.com
Description: private, offline meeting transcription (Afrikaans + English)
 Volksmond live-transcribes meetings locally on this machine: South
 African Afrikaans, English, and mixed-language audio. No cloud ASR,
 no telemetry, POPIA-friendly by design.
 .
 Captures the microphone and the system audio (PulseAudio/PipeWire
 monitor sources), transcribes with faster-whisper (CPU int8), and
 serves the app UI in a native WebKitGTK window. Transcripts and
 settings live in ~/.local/share/volksmond. The speech model is
 downloaded on first transcription (not bundled).
